This repository combines and modifies two research codebases.

  SCAN-Planner
  https://github.com/wuyi2121/SCAN-Planner

Original research authors:
  Han Zheng, Zhe Chen, Yiwen Fu, Ming Yang, and Tong Qin

Original project:
  SCAN-Planner: Spatial Collision-Aware Local Planning for
  Route-Guided Long-Range Quadruped Navigation
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.19555

The upstream project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This derivative preserves that license and adds ROS 2 Humble, Ubuntu 22.04,
ament_cmake, colcon, rclcpp, RViz2, tf2_ros and ROS 2 launch integration.

PCT planner
  https://github.com/byangw/PCT_planner
  Copyright (c) 2024 Bowen Yang and Jie Cheng
  GPL-2.0-or-later; original notice retained in src/pct/NOTICE

ROS 2 PCT port lineage
  https://github.com/2473o/PCT_planner/tree/feat/ros2pkg

PCT-SCAN-ROS2 modifications include ROS 2 packaging, relocatable PCT assets,
dynamic tomogram layers, interactive 3-D endpoints, clearance-biased A*, the
PCT-to-SCAN route bridge, multi-scene launch files, and visual Go2 execution.

The upstream authors and maintainers are not affiliated with, and do not
necessarily endorse, this combined project.

